    <title>00序言片：我们的十七岁</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6635daf84b7d3b5d3bf44f52</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6635daf84b7d3b5d3bf44f52</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 04 May 2024 06:51:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>十八岁仿佛是所有影视作品绕不开道的一个年龄。小的时候，我们仿佛总是幻想着一旦成年就会过上所向往的生活。但随着年龄的迫近，却越来越意识到事实并非如此。</span></p><span></span><p><span>重返十八岁的栏目将会邀请已经成年的“大人们，”围绕着抽选出的主题词谈论他们的十八岁。我希望借此栏目让听众和我们一起踏上思考之旅，探寻成长的奥秘和意义。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在正式开启前，我邀请到了我的好朋友Donna，我们将一切决定出三十个关键词供往后的嘉宾抽选。这些词汇有抽象的，也有具体的。但不约而同的都是，我们所好奇和在乎的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>准备好了吗？那我们开始《重返十八岁》栏目的第一期啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="165">02:45</a> 职业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="202">03:22</a> 避难所</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="250">04:10</a> 家</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="320">05:20</a> 故乡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="406">06:46</a> 音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="470">07:50</a> 服装</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="558">09:18</a> 眼泪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="631">10:31</a> 风</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="722">12:02</a> 超自然</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="831">13:51</a> 信仰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="878">14:38</a> 优绩主义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="917">15:17</a> 礼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="998">16:38</a> 钻戒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1086">18:06</a> 科研</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1217">20:17</a> Cheat</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1379">22:59</a> 电影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1447">24:07</a> 刺激</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1653">27:33</a> 温度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1659">27:39</a> 太阳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1687">28:07</a> 手写</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1707">28:27</a> 诗歌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1714">28:34</a> 洞穴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1720">28:40</a> 海洋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1721">28:41</a> 运动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1805">30:05</a> 高跟鞋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1917">31:57</a> 皱纹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1938">32:18</a> 充电</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1949">32:29</a> 自然</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1985">33:05</a> 聚光灯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1993">33:13</a> 友谊</span></p><span></span><p><span>非常感谢愿意听到这里的你！迷茫，痛苦，无所适从是隐藏在成年礼绚烂烟花下的主题。你想回到十八岁吗？我们下期再见👋</span></p>]]></description>
